WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:03.903
-President Trump has canceled
his summit with North Korea.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.237
Meanwhile, he and his allies

00:00:05.237 --> 00:00:07.073
are pushing
a baseless conspiracy theory

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.274
about the Russia probe.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.476
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:15.181
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.049
President Trump has spent weeks

00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:19.552
hyping his upcoming summit
with North Korea.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:21.620
He's earned glowing praise
from the media,

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.858
chants of Nobel from his crowds,
and his government even made

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:27.260
a commemorative coin
to mark the occasion.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.294
And you know what?

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.430
I was so excited,
I actually logged on

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.898
to the White House gift shop

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:34.134
and bought
one of those coins myself.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:35.301
Here it is.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.402
There it is.

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:38.704
Because I wanted
to be a part of history.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:41.273
So here's to you, Mr. President,
and all your success.

00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:42.908
-Breaking news.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:44.177
-Back with our breaking news --

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.545
President Trump has just written
a letter to Kim Jong-un,

00:00:46.545 --> 00:00:48.114
the Leader of North Korea,

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.350
canceling the June 12th
expected summit in Singapore.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:54.186
-Damn it!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:56.989
Although, it's my fault.

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.724
I should've learned my lesson
after I bought

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:01.194
commemorative coins
for the completed border wall,

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.628
"Biggest Inauguration Ever,"

00:01:02.628 --> 00:01:05.431
Anthony Scaramucci's
first 100 days on the job,

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:06.732
"Cleared of All Charges,"

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.534
and "People's
Sexiest Man Alive."

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.036
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:13.673
So, Trump canceled the summit,
which shouldn't surprise anyone.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.575
He earned backslaps
from the media,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.109
desperate to praise him
for something,

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:19.812
but he repeatedly made clear he
had no idea what he was doing.

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:22.114
For example, when he spoke today
at the White House,

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:25.819
Trump urged North Korea
to give up its nuclear weapons.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:27.687
-North Korea has the opportunity

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:30.857
to end decades
of poverty and oppression

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:34.327
by following the path
of denuclearization.

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:35.595
-There you go.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.563
He wants them to follow the path
of denuclearization.

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:41.034
But when he was asked on Tuesday
how denuclearization worked,

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:44.170
Trump claimed he totally knew
but wouldn't go into detail.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.174
-I do. I have a very strong idea
how it takes place,

00:01:49.174 --> 00:01:51.944
and it must take place.
That's what we're talking about.

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:54.547
It must take place.
But I have a very strong idea,

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:57.016
and I have very strong opinions
on the subject.

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:59.585
-Once again,
Donald Trump is a teenager

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.521
who didn't prepare
his oral report

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:04.190
and is now stalling
for the bell to ring.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.526
"I know a lot
about the Louisiana Purchase.

00:02:07.526 --> 00:02:09.995
It's fascinating --
a fascinating purchase.

00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:13.265
And, uh, I have very
strong feelings about it

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:14.334
that I want to show --

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:16.502
Will you ring,
you damn son of a bitch?"

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:17.637
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.539
So Trump is flailing
on foreign policy.

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.307
Maybe, just maybe,

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.342
he's distracted
by the Russian investigation,

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:25.311
which seems to get worse
for him every day.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.413
Since the investigation began,
Trump and his allies

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:30.116
have tossed out one crazy
conspiracy theory after another,

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:33.620
like when Trump said his wires
had been tapped at Trump Tower

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:35.321
or when they said two FBI agents

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.657
had a secret society
to undermine Trump.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:39.692
Trump loves conspiracy theories
so much,

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.594
I'm shocked
he hasn't accused Don Jr.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.963
of being a secret lizard person.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:45.999
"Have you seen
the way he blinks?"

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.201
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:50.803
Now, every one of those claims
turned out to be total B.S.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:53.806
In fact, Trump's crimes
are apparently so obvious

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:56.676
that his lawyer, Rudy Giuliani,
is now trying out a new tactic.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.911
Instead of denying
that collusion happened,

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:01.314
he's saying if it did happen,
it wasn't illegal.

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.349
In an interview with
Huffington Post Wednesday...

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:23.703
Yeah, if somebody gives you
something that's stole,

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.237
that doesn't
make you a criminal.

00:03:25.237 --> 00:03:26.939
It makes you a pawn shop.

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:28.340
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:31.277
Also, are we sure Giuliani isn't
working for Robert Mueller?

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.745
First, he told Sean Hannity

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.547
that Trump did pay off
Stormy Daniels.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:35.614
Now this.

00:03:35.614 --> 00:03:37.783
If you called Rudy in
for questioning,

00:03:37.783 --> 00:03:39.552
you wouldn't
need to do good cop/bad cop,

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:41.587
because he would confess
to the good cop.

00:03:41.587 --> 00:03:42.588
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.588 --> 00:03:44.624
"So, can I get you
a cup of coffee?"

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:47.459
"All right, I did it --
I killed my wife!"

00:03:47.459 --> 00:03:48.895
"We brought you in
for a robbery."

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.096
"I did that, too!"

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:51.164
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.532
If Rudy sang Bob Marley
at karaoke,

00:03:53.532 --> 00:03:55.734
he'd change the lyrics to,
"I shot the sheriff,

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:57.169
but I did not shoot the deputy.

00:03:57.169 --> 00:03:58.604
But even if I did
shoot the deputy,

00:03:58.604 --> 00:03:59.705
that wouldn't be illegal.

00:03:59.705 --> 00:04:01.206
And, also,
I did shoot the deputy."

00:04:01.206 --> 00:04:03.743
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:04.844
So...

00:04:04.844 --> 00:04:08.280
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.482
So, because
they don't have a good defense,

00:04:10.482 --> 00:04:12.385
Trump and his allies
have instead decided

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:15.020
to go on offense, creating
one fiction after another

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.688
to discredit
the investigation.

00:04:16.688 --> 00:04:18.257
A central figure in that effort

00:04:18.257 --> 00:04:20.626
has been Republican Congressman
Devin Nunes,

00:04:20.626 --> 00:04:22.495
who in every single photo

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:25.998
looks like he just realized he
brought you the wrong entrees.

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:28.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.569
"Oh, no.

00:04:30.569 --> 00:04:32.038
Oh.

00:04:32.038 --> 00:04:35.174
Oh, you said veal?
I thought you said eel."

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:36.876
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:39.244
Nunes has used his perch on
the House Oversight Committee

00:04:39.244 --> 00:04:41.514
to extract information
about the investigation

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:42.882
and then use that information

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:45.551
to help Trump
manufacture conspiracy theories.

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:46.952
And it's not just Nunes.

00:04:46.952 --> 00:04:48.987
Trump's allies
in the right-wing media

00:04:48.987 --> 00:04:51.858
have been happy to run with
his wild spying claims.

00:04:51.858 --> 00:04:55.194
Just take Fox News host
Maria Bartiromo.

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:57.430
She accused both President Obama
and Hillary Clinton

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:58.598
of being in a sinister plot

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:00.967
to take down Donald Trump
during the campaign.

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:02.802
Listen as she rambles
through a list

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:05.071
of all the favorite
right-wing buzzwords.

00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:08.740
-In March of 2016,
Sally Yates and Loretta Lynch

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.576
were both briefed by Jim Comey.

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:12.412
A couple of months later,
we start seeing

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:13.946
all the dossier information

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:16.048
and that there's
a dossier being written.

00:05:16.048 --> 00:05:19.052
And then, we know that
that dossier was used

00:05:19.052 --> 00:05:21.621
to get a warrant to wiretap

00:05:21.621 --> 00:05:23.555
and to spy
on the Trump campaign.

00:05:23.555 --> 00:05:25.991
We also know,
based on the text messages

00:05:25.991 --> 00:05:29.628
between FBI agent Peter Strzok
and his girlfriend, Lisa Page,

00:05:29.628 --> 00:05:32.799
that he said,
"President Obama wants to know

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:34.733
everything we're doing on this."

00:05:34.733 --> 00:05:35.901
So...
-Right.

00:05:35.901 --> 00:05:38.104
-Where was Obama?
I don't know.

00:05:38.104 --> 00:05:39.972
What do those texts
and all of this information

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:41.574
tell us where Obama was?

00:05:41.574 --> 00:05:43.576
It sounds like
either President Obama

00:05:43.576 --> 00:05:47.012
or Hillary Clinton were sort of
masterminding all of this.

00:05:47.012 --> 00:05:48.981
-Think about how insane
that theory is.

00:05:48.981 --> 00:05:50.816
She's saying Barack Obama
and Hillary Clinton

00:05:50.816 --> 00:05:53.285
sent a spy
to infiltrate Trump's campaign

00:05:53.285 --> 00:05:54.820
so they could get dirt on him

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:58.190
and then chose not to use that
dirt during the election.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:05:59.825
"Mr. President,
we found the pee tape.

00:05:59.825 --> 00:06:00.859
Should we leak it?"

00:06:00.859 --> 00:06:02.794
"No, no,
save it for my Netflix deal."

00:06:02.794 --> 00:06:09.102
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:09.102 --> 00:06:12.304
"I got an idea
for a limited series."

00:06:12.304 --> 00:06:15.274
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:17.710
You'd watch!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.012
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:21.547
Trump and his allies
are literally

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:23.816
just making [bleep] up,
and because he's the president,

00:06:23.816 --> 00:06:25.551
the media thinks
they have to take it seriously.

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:28.054
For example, Giuliani
made headlines over the weekend

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:29.522
when he claimed, out of nowhere,

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:32.224
that Mueller "hopes to finish
the obstruction investigation

00:06:32.224 --> 00:06:33.659
by September 1st.

00:06:33.659 --> 00:06:35.595
By putting end date
on the obstruction inquiry,

00:06:35.595 --> 00:06:38.063
he is apparently seeking
to publicly pressure Mueller

00:06:38.063 --> 00:06:39.532
to stick to that timeline.

00:06:39.532 --> 00:06:42.335
I'm sorry. You think you
can pressure Robert Mueller?

00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:43.469
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.469 --> 00:06:45.237
Look at that dude.

00:06:45.237 --> 00:06:47.640
That dude plays Jenga to relax.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:48.708
[ Laughter ]

00:06:48.708 --> 00:06:52.144
He has more steel in him
than Wolverine.

00:06:52.144 --> 00:06:54.246
His last job was support beam.

00:06:54.246 --> 00:06:57.282
They make skyscrapers
out of Robert Muellers.

00:06:57.282 --> 00:06:59.685
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:02.922
Well, this will shock you.

00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:05.557
It turned out Rudy's claim about
the September 1st deadline

00:07:05.557 --> 00:07:06.759
was entirely made up.

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:08.628
Like Trump,
Rudy just goes on TV,

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:10.163
makes stuff up,
and the media repeats it

00:07:10.163 --> 00:07:11.263
because they think they have to.

00:07:11.263 --> 00:07:13.632
For example,
Rudy also claimed recently

00:07:13.632 --> 00:07:15.934
that the President could just
ignore a subpoena from Mueller

00:07:15.934 --> 00:07:18.236
because past presidents
have done the same thing.

00:07:18.236 --> 00:07:21.407
But after he said that,
a clip of Giuliani from 1998

00:07:21.407 --> 00:07:23.776
resurfaced, insisting that
then-President Clinton

00:07:23.776 --> 00:07:26.678
would have to testify
if he was subpoenaed.

00:07:26.678 --> 00:07:30.816
-If the president
is asked to testify,

00:07:30.816 --> 00:07:34.453
subpoenaed to testify
before a grand jury,

00:07:34.453 --> 00:07:38.257
and says, "No,
not gonna do it..."

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:40.359
-You gotta do it.
I mean, you don't have a choice.

00:07:40.359 --> 00:07:42.594
-Well, he said in a statement
that he might not do it.

00:07:42.594 --> 00:07:45.164
-Well, then, there is
a procedure for handling that.

00:07:45.164 --> 00:07:47.532
You go before a judge,
and a judge decides

00:07:47.532 --> 00:07:51.370
whether or not
he has a recognizable exemption

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.771
or privilege from testifying.

00:07:52.771 --> 00:07:53.972
And if a judge
decides he doesn't,

00:07:53.972 --> 00:07:55.073
then you have to testify.

00:07:55.073 --> 00:07:56.308
You don't have
a choice about that.

00:07:56.308 --> 00:07:58.477
-Wow, that interview
has not aged well.

00:07:58.477 --> 00:07:59.912
[ Laughter ]

00:07:59.912 --> 00:08:03.615
Unlike Rudy Giuliani who doesn't
look a day over Crypt-Keeper.

00:08:03.615 --> 00:08:05.151
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:09.255
So, Rudy is obviously lying
and contradicting himself.

00:08:09.255 --> 00:08:10.589
And yet the media
keeps talking to him.

00:08:10.589 --> 00:08:12.624
Last week on CNN,
Rudy insisted

00:08:12.624 --> 00:08:14.393
that if Mueller
were to subpoena Trump,

00:08:14.393 --> 00:08:16.062
he would interfere
in the investigation

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:18.497
by going to Attorney General
Jeff Sessions

00:08:18.497 --> 00:08:21.099
and Deputy Attorney General
Rod Rosenstein

00:08:21.099 --> 00:08:23.302
and telling them
to stop the subpoena.

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:24.871
-If Mueller did it,
the Justice Department

00:08:24.871 --> 00:08:26.138
could take the subpoena
right back.

00:08:26.138 --> 00:08:28.607
-Or you could just litigate it.

00:08:28.607 --> 00:08:30.075
He could subpoena him,
and you could litigate it.

00:08:30.075 --> 00:08:31.377
-I'd go right
to the Attorney General,

00:08:31.377 --> 00:08:33.946
I'd say, "Jeff, you know,
put on big-boy pants,

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:36.248
and you go take it away.
-But he's recused from this.

00:08:36.248 --> 00:08:37.650
-Then I'd go to Rosenstein
and say,

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.452
"You want to try
the big-boy pants on for size?

00:08:39.452 --> 00:08:41.420
You put them on, and you
get rid of the subpoena."

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.689
-Rudy sounds like
a flustered salesman

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:45.324
at a store
called Big Boy Pants.

00:08:45.324 --> 00:08:46.892
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.892 --> 00:08:48.794
"What about you?
Two-for-one Big Boy Pants?

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:51.797
Oh, come on, Rudy.
You gotta make a sale!

00:08:51.797 --> 00:08:53.398
[ Laughter ]

00:08:53.398 --> 00:08:54.834
And I'm sorry,
but if Jeff Sessions

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:57.469
tried to put on big-boy pants,
they'd go up to his nipples.

00:08:57.469 --> 00:08:59.104
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:59.104 --> 00:09:01.840
Now, there is no reason --

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.877
no reason to ever believe
what Trump, Rudy or their allies

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:06.111
say about
the Russia investigation.

00:09:06.111 --> 00:09:07.546
They've proven
time and time again

00:09:07.546 --> 00:09:08.714
they have no compulsion

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:10.382
about lying
and contradicting themselves.

00:09:10.382 --> 00:09:12.518
The media should
stop taking them seriously.

00:09:12.518 --> 00:09:14.319
In other words,
the media should put on their...

00:09:14.319 --> 00:09:15.387
-Big-boy pants.

00:09:15.387 --> 00:09:17.156
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:17.156 --> 00:09:20.526
[ Cheers and applause ]

